      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes it's been broken since the Avatar Store update.\n\nHere's a video example:\n\n- I add avatars to favorites\n\n- go to my favorites list\n\n- observe that they're not at the top, but somewhere in random place - despite the sort mode set to \"Date Added\"\n\nhttps://youtu.be/30mcEYWF1Qk",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
