  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-07-09T19:50:26.752Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When viewing your favorited avatars in any category, whether it be through the mini-menu wing or through the big menu, if you enable \"Sort By: Date Added\", the avatars don't get sorted correctly. The expectation is that they should appear in the order you favorited them, but they're simply jumbled up and unorganized.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\n1. Favorite multiple avatars over time.\n\n2. Go to your favorites list.\n\n3. Sort the avatars by “Date Added.”\n\n4. See that the list does not maintain the chronological order of when avatars were favorited, and appears rather scrambled.",
